Package: shinyalcatraz
Title: Build Portable, Zero-Admin-Install Shiny Apps for Locked-Down Environments
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Lau", "Yee How", email = "lauyeehow1986@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Given a Shiny application, builds one or more self-contained,
    copy-and-run deployment bundles that require no administrator rights
    and no internet access on the target machine. Supports multiple build
    targets from a single app source: a pure-browser WebAssembly bundle
    (via 'shinylive'/'webR', no R install needed at all), a portable-R
    bundle (bundled R runtime + package library, launched via a local
    'httpuv' server), and a native shell wrapper (via 'Tauri') for a
    double-click desktop/mobile experience across Windows, macOS, Linux,
    Android and iOS.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
